### API Integration Sandbox
### Use this file with REST Client extensions (like VS Code REST Client) to test the live API endpoints.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@jwtToken = YOUR_JWT_OR_SERVICE_KEY_HERE
@apiKey = YOUR_X_API_KEY_HERE

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# TEAMMATE 4 (Scanner App)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Log a Hospital Receipt Scan
# This simulates scanning a barcode at the hospital receiving dock.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scan_events
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "batch_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", 
    "node_type": "hospital",
    "node_id": "HOSP_001",
    "location": "Hospital Receiving: HOSP_001",
    "timestamp": "2025-05-10T16:00:00Z",
    "raw_payload": {
        "shipment_id": "SHIP_00001",
        "status": "received",
        "quantity": 1825
    }
}


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# TEAMMATE 3 (Anomaly Engine)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Log a Caught Conflict (PCM-2025-A01 expiry mismatch)
# This simulates the Anomaly Engine detecting the deliberate batch expiry conflict.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/anomalies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
    "batch_id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "rule_triggered": "batch_expiry_consistency",
    "details": {
        "conflict": "Expiry date mismatch detected between DB and ledger",
        "severity": "HIGH",
        "expected": "2013-12-31",
        "found": "2025-12-31"
    }
}


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# FRONTEND / GENERAL
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Verify ML Proxy Route
# This routes through FastAPI directly to the ML microservice.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forecast/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Accept: application/json
